{
  "name": "Gradient Map",
  "notes": "`index: \"position\"` IS a gradient map: the emitter is a `block` filled to 1.0, saying nothing but \"all of it, at full weight\", and every pixel's colour comes from where it sits. Geometry supplies coverage, position supplies the lookup.\n\nThe scroll is `paletteOffset` on a `ramp_up` at depth exactly 1.0 -- the offset wraps and the ramp is a full unipolar sweep, so the gradient leaves one end and returns at the other with no seam, and `wrap` is on because the palette has to be a ring for that to be true. The second layer is the SAME map at `paletteSpan` 2.4 under a `tile`, running the other way at a third of the speed, so the strip carries a slow wide gradient with a fast narrow one beating against it -- and because the two share a palette, the interference is in hue and brightness at once.\n\nThe palette is an ultraviolet analogous run with one sodium accent at the far end: four hues inside 45 degrees and a fifth 150 away, so most of the strip is one colour with depth in it and the gold arrives as an event rather than as a third of the spectrum. `M2` drives `M0.rate`, so the scroll surges and eases instead of ticking.",
  "layers": {
    "0": {
      "emitter": {
        "type": "block",
        "params": {
          "level": 1,
          "softness": 0
        }
      },
      "colour": {
        "index": "position",
        "wrap": true,
        "palette": {
          "params": {
            "saturation": 2,
            "value": 2
          },
          "entries": [
            "3200ff",
            "6e00ff",
            "aa00ff",
            "e600ff",
            "ffc800"
          ]
        },
        "params": {
          "indexBias": -1
        }
      },
      "blend": "add",
      "opacity": 0.15,
      "order": 0
    },
    "1": {
      "emitter": {
        "type": "block",
        "params": {
          "level": 1,
          "softness": 0
        }
      },
      "colour": {
        "index": "position",
        "wrap": true,
        "params": {
          "paletteSpan": 2.4,
          "indexBias": -1
        },
        "palette": {
          "params": {
            "saturation": 2,
            "value": 2
          },
          "entries": [
            "3200ff",
            "6e00ff",
            "aa00ff",
            "e600ff",
            "ffc800"
          ]
        }
      },
      "warps": [
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "params": {
            "count": 3
          }
        }
      ],
      "blend": "screen",
      "opacity": 0.45,
      "order": 1
    }
  },
